{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41690","headline":"夜别温商梓州 · 陈陶","name":"夜别温商梓州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"凤皇城里花时别，玄武江边月下逢。\n客舍莫辞先买酒，相门曾忝旧登龙。\n迎风骚屑千家竹，隔水悠扬午夜钟。\n明日又行西蜀去，不堪天际远山重。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41690.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41690","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}